From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yoshi Sugawara <yoshi.sugawara@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 09:06:01 -1000
Subject: [PATCH] nacp: a title with a full-width space is a name

Japanese titles put U+3000 between words, which isprintable rejects, so the
NSP script found no game name for DRAGON QUEST XI S (010054A0085CA000).
Whitespace is normalised to a plain space first.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: DRAGON QUEST XI S JP (010054A0085CA000) bring-up on iOS: see the commit message
Issue: none yet (local bring-up of DRAGON QUEST XI S JP, 010054A0085CA000)

---
 dm/tools/nacp.py | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/dm/tools/nacp.py b/dm/tools/nacp.py
index a912fb0..a75c24f 100644
--- a/dm/tools/nacp.py
+++ b/dm/tools/nacp.py
@@ -25,6 +25,7 @@ def name(path):
         if not n: continue
         try: n = n.decode('utf-8')
         except UnicodeDecodeError: return ''
+        n = re.sub(r'\s', ' ', n)   # Japanese titles put a full-width space (U+3000) between words, which isprintable rejects (DRAGON QUEST XI S)
         return n if n.isprintable() else ''
     return ''
 
